  "title": "What CRE Can Learn From Multifamily About Building Community",
  "summary": "For years, commercial real estate has focused heavily on location, amenities, access, and the physical space itself. But as tenants’ expectations continue to evolve, one factor is becoming increasingly important: community.Multifamily has been navigating this shift for years. Apartment communities aren’t simply selling four walls and a lease—they’re creating experiences designed to make residents feel connected to the place they call home.Commercial real estate can take a page from that playbook",
